      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "High-dose iron supplementation like 300mg daily can be extremely dangerous and may cause severe side effects without a confirmed deficiency first. It is essential to get blood work done by a healthcare provider before starting any iron regimen, as taking too much can lead to iron toxicity and internal bleeding. I strongly recommend consulting a doctor to determine if you actually need iron and safe dosing rather than trying aggressive \"biohacking\" methods online.",
      "source": "target",
